      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَفْتُولٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَتِيلٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [It also signifies (tropical:)  <i>Compact,</i> or <i>firm, in make;</i> as though twisted; like
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَجْدُولٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعْصُوبٌ</span>:] you say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجُلٌ مَفْتُولُ السَّاعِدِ</span>
<i>A man strong</i> [or <i>firm</i> or <i>compact</i>] <i>in the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ساعد</span>
[or <i>fore arm</i>]; as though it were twisted. (TA.)

